# Adamant Will: "Target creature" - any creature, whoever controls it, and nothing that is not one. On turn 3 Bot1 may not target
# its own Mox Pearl (an artifact that is not a creature, CR 115.1), and may target Bot2's Balduvian Bears (the positive control): the
# Bears become a 4/4 with indestructible while Bot1's own Isamaru is left a 2/2 (CR 611.2a: only the target is affected).

